  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add garlic and ginger and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add bok choi and stir-fry for 3 minutes until wilted.",
    "Add Kimchi and gochujang and stir-fry for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add cooked rice to the pan and stir-fry for 2 minutes until combined.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Transfer to a bowl and garnish with toasted sesame seeds and scallions.",
    "Serve hot."
